    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this 16 by 16 pixel world as snow falls quietly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/4033839ac8733914c48665c66def4d13.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over big gaps as you collect all your items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/281529f72b79acbd5ef74fd88ba7bfb2.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the items on the many objects around the map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/68c523fa3d5dccab2cdbe909a8f7065b.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change modes between the normal mode, the always jumping mode, and the speed running mode as you change your outfit to green or yellow, respectively.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/f0aab713efa40e9506f17bc3b8c4fb3a.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/1c9176c614b560082a8d55f24b82715f.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short game is a great game to play while watching snow fall during the holidays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret passageways as you make your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/49494bea67e04d7043a86e5246084f33.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this 16 by 16 pixel world as snow falls quietly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/4033839ac8733914c48665c66def4d13.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap over big gaps as you collect all your items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/281529f72b79acbd5ef74fd88ba7bfb2.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place the items on the many objects around the map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/68c523fa3d5dccab2cdbe909a8f7065b.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change modes between the normal mode, the always jumping mode, and the speed running mode as you change your outfit to green or yellow, respectively.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/f0aab713efa40e9506f17bc3b8c4fb3a.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/1c9176c614b560082a8d55f24b82715f.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This short game is a great game to play while watching snow fall during the holidays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret passageways as you make your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324040/extras/49494bea67e04d7043a86e5246084f33.avif?t=1732819288\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Put items back in their places in a winter wonderland as you try to beat your fastest time. Small Santa Simulator is a 2D platformer where you collect holiday themed items and put them back where they belong. Christmas is soon and everything must be ready for the big day, will you save Christmas?",
